&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who we are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab ® is a global leader in IoT and connected transportation and certified “Great Place to Work™.” We are a company of diverse and talented individuals who work together to help businesses grow and succeed, and increase the safety and sustainability of our communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab is advancing security, connecting commercial vehicles to the internet and providing web-based analytics to help customers better manage their fleets. Geotab’s open platform and Geotab Marketplace ®, offering hundreds of third-party solution options, allows both small and large businesses to automate operations by integrating vehicle data with their other data assets. Processing billions of data points a day, Geotab leverages data analytics and machine learning to improve productivity, optimize fleets through the reduction of fuel consumption, enhance driver safety and achieve strong compliance to regulatory changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Our team is growing and we’re looking for people who follow their passion, think differently and want to make an impact. Ours is a fast paced, ever changing environment. Geotabbers accept that challenge and are willing to take on new tasks and activities - ones that may not always be described in the initial job description. Join us for a fulfilling career with opportunities to innovate, great benefits, and our fun and inclusive work culture. Reach your full potential with Geotab. To see what it’s like to be a Geotabber, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.geotab.com/blog/&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us @InsideGeotab on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidegeotab/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot;&gt;We are always looking for amazing talent who can contribute to our growth and deliver results! Geotab is seeking an Embedded Camera Developer who will design, develop, and optimize the firmware stack for Geotab’s AI-enabled camera devices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2&quot;&gt;. If you love technology, and are keen to join an industry leader — we would love to hear from you&lt;/span&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot;&gt;As an Embedded Camera Developer your key area of responsibility will be writing and testing high-quality code within Embedded Linux environments, implementing high-performance code for image processing pipelines, managing power consumption for edge-deployment, ensuring robust data integrity and security, and collaborating with cross-functional technical teams to deliver stable, scalable camera solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2&quot;&gt;. You will need to work closely with hardware teams and cross-functional technical teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4&quot;&gt;To be successful in this role you will be a self-starter, highly organized, meticulous, with high attention to detail, and a strong team player who can research and solve open-ended design problems while communicating complex technical decisions effectively&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,6&quot;&gt;. In addition, the successful candidate will have strong technical, analytical, and troubleshooting skills, with the ability to manage priorities among multiple tasks in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and test embedded firmware for AI-enabled camera systems using C/C++, including architectural input on camera subsystem design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3854bb8a39165a4c-41&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Integrate and optimize ISP pipelines, video encoding/decoding modules&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3854bb8a39165a4c-42&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Develop an in-depth understanding of the Geotab IoT devices (such as telematics devices, extendibility products, asset trackers, Video products) firmware and how various modules work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3854bb8a39165a4c-43&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with hardware teams to interpret data sheets and ensure seamless component integration through low-level hardware-software co-design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3854bb8a39165a4c-44&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Root causes and resolves complex firmware issues, including streaming latency, frame reordering, system crashes, and memory bottlenecks. Debug firmware issues using specialised tools (logic analyzer, oscilloscopes, JTAG, signal analyzers for MIPI-CSI) when necessary to troubleshoot hardware-software integration issues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3854bb8a39165a4c-45&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Develop unit, integration, and system-level tests (e.g., Pytest, Robot Framework) to validate feature requirements in real and simulated camera environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3854bb8a39165a4c-46&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,0&quot;&gt;Participate in modular, reusable, hardware independent software/firmware development practices and adhere to test driven development principles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3854bb8a39165a4c-47&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,0&quot;&gt;Write scalable, high quality, secure embedded software using Geotab’s development standards in a variety of programming languages like C, C++, Python for Embedded Linux as required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,7,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3854bb8a39165a4c-48&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,0&quot;&gt;Documentation: Maintain accurate technical documentation for firmware architectures, interfaces, and debugging procedures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,8,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_3854bb8a39165a4c-49&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,9,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,9,0,0&quot;&gt;Conduct comprehensive testing and code reviews to ensure that industry coding standards are followed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,0&quot;&gt;5+ years of technical experience in development of image processing pipelines, video streams, object-oriented design, multithreaded programming, unit testing, and Linux platform development (user-space)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Post-secondary Diploma/Degree with specialization in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Electrical Engineering, or a related field (or equivalent combination of education and work experience)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,0&quot;&gt;High proficiency in C/C++ for concurrent systems, experience in preemptive, multi-threaded Embedded Linux / Android environments, and proficiency in scripting languages like Bash or Python&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Expertise in troubleshooting camera-specific issues (e.g., frame synchronization, memory bottlenecks, stream stability) and performance profiling (CPU/Memory/Power) on embedded SoCs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Practical knowledge of reading schematics and data sheets for components, microcontrollers, communication protocols (I2C, SPI, UART, MIPI-CSI), and hardware-software integration on embedded targets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience or familiarity with test frameworks (Pytest, Robot Framework), version control and task management tools (GIT, SQL, JIRA), CI/CD pipelines, and Agile/Scrum development methodologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0,0&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, strong organizational abilities with a high attention to detail, and a comfortable, entrepreneurial mindset in a flat organizational structure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;If you got this far, we hope you&#39;re feeling excited about this role! Even if you don&#39;t feel you meet every single requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: Geotab does not accept agency resumes and is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes. Please do not forward resumes to Geotab employees.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How we work:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;The health and safety of employees are a top priority. We encourage work-life balance and keep the Geotab culture going strong with online social events, chat rooms and gatherings. Join us and help reshape the future of technology!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;We believe that ensuring diversity is fundamental to our future growth and progress and is an integral part of our business. We believe that success happens where new ideas can flourish – in an environment that is rich in diversity and a place where people from various backgrounds can work together. Geotab encourages applications from all qualified individuals.&amp;nbsp; We are committed to accommodating people with disabilities during the recruitment and assessment processes and when people are hired. We will ensure the accessibility needs of employees with disabilities are taken into account as part of performance management, career development, training and redeployment processes. If you require accommodation at any stage of the application process or want more information about our diversity and inclusion as well as accommodation policies and practices, please contact us at careers@geotab.com. By submitting a job application to Geotab Inc. or its affiliates and subsidiaries (collectively, “Geotab”), you acknowledge Geotab’s collection, use and disclosure of your personal data in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.geotab.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uE3uV2SSp0YnYx4utU9QdhN8Q_RzqMphI_pVJyVWQn8/edit?tab=t.0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to read our Privacy Notice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
